From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 20:30:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: rewrite pasted links by rules

Rules live in tele_kv: either domain rules (from/to lists, the host is
swapped keeping www/m/mobile prefixes out, several targets are picked
per url) or pattern rules (regex find, replace template with $1..$9
group refs and $$ for a literal dollar). Pasting into the message
field intercepts android.R.id.paste: when the clipboard text changes,
the rewritten version is inserted at the cursor and a toast lists what
changed; untouched clips fall through to stock paste. Off by default.

Constraint: intercepts only when a rule actually rewrote something
Rejected: rewriting on send | pasting is where the author decides
Confidence: medium
Scope-risk: narrow
